input.content:
:root {
  --ink: #0d2436;
  --ink-soft: #173b52;
  --cream: #fff4dc;
  --cream-deep: #f4e2bd;
  --orange: #ff7a3d;
  --orange-deep: #d9531f;
  --red: #e6382f;
  --sky: #79c8f0;
  --green: #58a437;
  --shadow: rgba(5, 17, 28, 0.55);
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html,
body {
  height: 100%;
  margin: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #0a1624;
  color: var(--cream);
  font-family: "Trebuchet MS", "Segoe UI", Verdana, sans-serif;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}

body {
  overscroll-behavior: none;
  -webkit-user-select: none;
  user-select: none;
}

#game-shell {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100vh;
  height: 100dvh;
  overflow: hidden;
  isolation: isolate;
}

#game {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  touch-action: none;
  cursor: crosshair;
}

.vignette {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 2;
  pointer-events: none;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 90px rgba(4, 18, 30, 0.42), inset 0 0 18px rgba(4, 18, 30, 0.22);
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- HUD */

.hud {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 5;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  padding:
    calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-top))
    calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-right))
    0
    calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-left));
  pointer-events: none;
}

.hud-group {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 8px;
}

.hud-group--right { align-items: center; }

.stat {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  min-width: 78px;
  padding: 6px 11px 7px;
  border: 2px solid rgba(255, 244, 220, 0.86);
  border-radius: 13px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(14, 44, 64, 0.85), rgba(9, 28, 43, 0.83));
  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 rgba(4, 15, 25, 0.35), 0 8px 18px rgba(4, 15, 25, 0.2);
  backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
}

.stat-label {
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  line-height: 1.1;
  color: #ffcf7a;
}

.stat-value {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  color: var(--cream);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.stat--wave { min-width: 58px; }
.stat--wave .stat-value { font-size: 17px; }

.stat--ammo {
  flex-direction: row;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 7px 11px;
}

.stat--ammo .stat-label {
  order: 2;
  font-size: 8px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  color: #ffcf7a;
}

.stat--ammo .stat-value { order: 3; font-size: 18px; }
.stat--ammo .bomb-glyph { order: 1; width: 18px; height: 18px; color: var(--orange); }

.stat--ammo.empty {
  border-color: rgba(255, 122, 61, 0.95);
  animation: ammo-empty 0.7s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes ammo-empty {
  from { box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(255, 122, 61, 0); }
  to { box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 122, 61, 0.55); }
}

.icon-btn {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  padding: 0;
  border: 2px solid rgba(255, 244, 220, 0.82);
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(9, 28, 43, 0.82);
  color: var(--cream);
  cursor: pointer;
  pointer-events: auto;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 rgba(4, 15, 25, 0.35);
  transition: transform 0.12s ease, background 0.12s ease;
}

.icon-btn svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }

.icon-btn:hover { background: rgba(20, 55, 78, 0.95); transform: translateY(-1px); }
.icon-btn:active { transform: translateY(2px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(4, 15, 25, 0.35); }

.icon-btn:focus-visible,
.cta:focus-visible,
.bomb-btn:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid #ffd27a;
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

#soundBtn .icon-off { display: none; }
#soundBtn.muted .icon-on { display: none; }
#soundBtn.muted .icon-off { display: block; }

.hint {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 4;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 7px 13px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 244, 220, 0.24);
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(8, 26, 40, 0.62);
  color: rgba(255, 244, 220, 0.84);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  white-space: nowrap;
  backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.hint .dot { opacity: 0.45; }

kbd {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 2px 6px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 244, 220, 0.4);
  border-bottom-width: 2px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  background: rgba(255, 244, 220, 0.1);
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--cream);
}

/* -------------------------------------------------------- Bomb button */

.bomb-btn {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 6;
  right: calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-right));
  bottom: calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  display: none;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 92px;
  height: 92px;
  padding: 0;
  border: 3px solid #102b40;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 34% 28%, #ffb06b 0%, var(--orange) 45%, var(--orange-deep) 100%);
  color: #35160a;
  cursor: pointer;
  touch-action: none;
  box-shadow: 0 7px 0 #8f2f16, 0 14px 24px rgba(6, 18, 30, 0.4), inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  transition: transform 0.08s ease, box-shadow 0.08s ease, filter 0.15s ease;
}

.bomb-btn svg {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  margin-top: -12px;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22));
}

.bomb-btn__ring {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 6px;
  border: 2px dashed rgba(53, 22, 10, 0.34);
  border-radius: 50%;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.bomb-btn__label {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 12px;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-align: center;
  color: #35160a;
}

.bomb-btn.is-down {
  transform: translateY(5px) scale(0.97);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #8f2f16, 0 8px 16px rgba(6, 18, 30, 0.35), inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
}

.bomb-btn.is-empty {
  filter: grayscale(0.65) brightness(0.78);
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------ Overlay */

.overlay {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 10;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding:
    calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-top))
    calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-right))
    calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))
    calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-left));
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, rgba(9, 30, 47, 0.24), rgba(5, 17, 28, 0.74) 78%);
  backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
  overflow: auto;
}

.overlay.hidden { display: none; }
.card.hidden { display: none; }

.card {
  position: relative;
  width: min(552px, 100%);
  padding: 26px 26px 22px;
  color: var(--ink);
  border: 3px solid #102b40;
  border-radius: 22px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 38%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, #fff7e4 0%, #f7e6c2 100%);
  box-shadow:
    0 10px 0 #0d2436,
    0 26px 50px rgba(2, 10, 18, 0.55),
    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
  animation: card-in 0.34s cubic-bezier(0.2, 1.2, 0.4, 1) both;
}

@keyframes card-in {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px) scale(0.97); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
}

.card::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 9px;
  border: 1.5px dashed rgba(13, 36, 54, 0.18);
  border-radius: 15px;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.eyebrow {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: inline-block;
  margin-bottom: 7px;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--ink);
  color: #ffcf7a;
  font-size: 9.5px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.24em;
}

.title {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(42px, 9.5vw, 66px);
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 0.9;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  color: var(--ink);
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.title span {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-left: 0.12em;
  color: var(--orange-deep);
  -webkit-text-stroke: 0;
  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(13, 36, 54, 0.14);
}

.lede {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  margin: 12px 0 17px;
  max-width: 44ch;
  font-size: 13.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: #30536a;
}

.how {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: grid;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.how-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 11px;
  padding: 8px 11px;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(13, 36, 54, 0.14);
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.42);
}

.how-icon {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
  border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  border-radius: 9px;
  background: #bfe9ff;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 1;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(13, 36, 54, 0.22);
}

.how-icon--bomb {
  background: #ffd0a8;
  color: var(--orange-deep);
  font-size: 14px;
}

.how-icon--target {
  background: #ffe0dc;
  color: var(--red);
}

.how-item strong {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 1px;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.how-item span {
  display: block;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.35;
  color: #476173;
}

.cta {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 54px;
  padding: 14px 20px;
  border: 3px solid #102b40;
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffa465 0%, var(--orange) 42%, #ef6528 100%);
  color: #2c1206;
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #8f2f16, 0 12px 20px rgba(6, 18, 30, 0.22), inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  transition: transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.1s ease, filter 0.15s ease;
}

.cta svg { width: 21px; height: 21px; }

.cta:hover { filter: brightness(1.05); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #8f2f16, 0 16px 24px rgba(6, 18, 30, 0.24), inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); }
.cta:active { transform: translateY(4px); box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #8f2f16, 0 6px 12px rgba(6, 18, 30, 0.2), inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); }

.cta--ghost {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  color: var(--ink);
  box-shadow: 0 5px 0 rgba(13, 36, 54, 0.28), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
}

.cta--ghost:hover { box-shadow: 0 7px 0 rgba(13, 36, 54, 0.28), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); }
.cta--ghost:active { box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(13, 36, 54, 0.28), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); }

.footnote {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  margin: 13px 0 0;
  font-size: 10.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: #627b8b;
  text-align: center;
}

.pause-title {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(32px, 7vw, 44px);
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.pause-actions {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: grid;
  gap: 10px;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------ Mobile */

@media (pointer: coarse) {
  .bomb-btn { display: flex; }
  .hint { display: none; }
  #game { cursor: default; }
  .stat { padding: 5px 9px 6px; min-width: 66px; }
  .stat-value { font-size: 18px; }
  .stat--ammo .stat-label { display: none; }
  .icon-btn { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
  .hud { gap: 6px; }
  .hud-group { gap: 6px; }
}

@media (max-width: 460px) {
  .card { padding: 21px 18px 18px; border-radius: 19px; box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #0d2436, 0 20px 40px rgba(2, 10, 18, 0.55); }
  .how-item { padding: 7px 9px; gap: 9px; }
  .how-icon { width: 30px; height: 30px; font-size: 15px; }
  .how-item span { font-size: 10.5px; }
  .lede { font-size: 12.5px; margin: 10px 0 14px; }
  .cta { min-height: 50px; font-size: 14px; }
  .bomb-btn { width: 84px; height: 84px; }
  .bomb-btn svg { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
  .hint { display: none; }
}

@media (max-height: 620px) {
  .card { padding: 18px 20px 16px; }
  .title { font-size: clamp(34px, 8vw, 46px); }
  .how { gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .how-item { padding: 6px 9px; }
  .how-icon { width: 28px; height: 28px; font-size: 14px; }
  .lede { margin: 8px 0 12px; font-size: 12px; }
  .footnote { display: none; }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .card { animation: none; }
  .stat--ammo.empty { animation: none; }
}

content.text:
Now the JS. This is the big part. Let's write carefully.

I'll lay out in sections:

1. DOM refs, helpers
2. View/resize, clouds/decor gen
3. Audio
4. State
5. Plane/bomb/targets logic
6. Particles/explosions
7. Render functions
8. Input/UI
9. Loop/init

Be careful about function hoisting and initialization order (const at top, then init call at bottom).

Implementation details for drawing. Let me write code mentally then output.

Plane drawing function:

```js
function drawPlane(){
  const s = view.scale;
  // shadow
  const alt = clamp((view.groundY - plane.y) / view.groundY, 0, 1);
  ctx.save();
  ctx.globalAlpha = 0.2 * (1 - alt * 0.55);
  ctx.fillStyle = '#123b1f';
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.ellipse(plane.x, view.groundY + 4, 58*s*(1-alt*0.3), 10*s, 0, 0, TAU);
  ctx.fill();
  ctx.restore();

  ctx.save();
  ctx.translate(plane.x, plane.y);
  ctx.rotate(plane.angle);
  ctx.scale(s,s);

  // propeller disc
  const propA = 0.10 + Math.sin(g.time*30)*0.04;
  ctx.save();
  ctx.translate(70, -2);
  ctx.rotate(plane.prop*0.35); // not really visible
  ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255,255,255,${propA})`;
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.ellipse(0,0, 5, 31, 0, 0, TAU);
  ctx.fill();
  // blades
  const a = plane.prop;
  ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(40,45,40,.55)';
  ctx.lineWidth=3;
  for(let i=0;i<2;i++){
    const ang = a + i*Math.PI;
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0,0); ctx.lineTo(Math.cos(ang)*4, Math.sin(ang)*29); ctx.stroke();
  }
  ctx.restore();
  // spinner
  ...
```
Hmm propeller at side view: disc vertical ellipse (x radius 6, y radius 30) at (72,-2). Blades endpoints vertical. Rotation in projected view flips horizontal only; use `Math.sin` for x offset. Draw two blades as lines to (sin(a)*3, ±29). Fine.

Plane body order: tail fin behind fuselage, wing behind body? Draw:
1. tail fin
2. horizontal stabilizer
3. wing (behind fuselage) maybe under
4. fuselage
5. cockpit
6. prop
7. details

Fuselage gradient:
```js
const body = ctx.createLinearGradient(0,-22,0,20);
body.addColorStop(0,'#9aab74');
body.addColorStop(0.55,'#778c56');
body.addColorStop(1,'#4f6a3e');
```

Shape defined earlier. Add cream belly overlay path clipped? Use `ctx.save(); ctx.clip()` with fuselage path then draw ellipse at bottom cream alpha. Then restore.

Cockpit at (6,-14), dome:
```js
ctx.beginPath(); ctx.ellipse(6,-17,15,11,0,Math.PI,0); // top half? 
```
A bubble canopy: path from (-6,-16) quad to (18,-16) up curve. Fill #a8e8ff gradient, stroke dark, add highlight arc, pilot head circle #f0c48a at (2,-14) radius 4 with helmet dark green.

Tail fin path: (-55,6) -> (-72,-38) -> (-56,-38) -> (-40,4)? Fill dark olive. Red tip stripe. Horizontal stabilizer: (-52,4) -> (-72,10) -> (-50,14).

Wing: low wing shape from (-12,6) -> (26,4) -> (20,26) -> (-4,24) close. Fill darker olive #5e7444. Add cream stripe.

Roundel at (-20, 4): outer #e6382f r=7, inner cream r=4.5, center red r=2.5? Actually Turkish roundel is red outer with white crescent-star. Simplify: red circle with white inner circle and red center dot.

Bomb under wing: if ammo>0 draw small dark bomb at (16,24) rotated slight. Adds detail.

Exhaust: small gray pipe under nose.

Highlight: stroke along top with cream alpha 0.4.

Nose: dark cowl circle at (62,0) r=11 with ring; propeller in front.

Bomb draw:
```js
function drawBomb(b){
 const s=view.scale;
 ctx.save(); ctx.translate(b.x,b.y); ctx.rotate(Math.atan2(b.vx, b.vy)); ctx.scale(s,s);
 // fins
 ctx.fillStyle='#39424a';
 ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(-6,-8); ctx.lineTo(-9,-14); ctx.lineTo(0,-10); ctx.lineTo(9,-14); ctx.lineTo(6,-8); ctx.closePath(); ctx.fill();
 // body
 ctx.fillStyle='#4b545c';
 ctx.beginPath(); ctx.roundRect(-4,-10,8,17,4); ctx.fill();
 // nose
 ctx.fillStyle='#2d353c'; ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(0,7,4,0,TAU); ctx.fill();
 // stripe
 ctx.fillStyle='#ff7a3d'; ctx.fillRect(-4,-2,8,3);
 ctx.restore();
}
```
roundRect supported modern browsers; provide fallback helper? Chrome supports. Fine.

Prop shadow maybe.

Explosion flash draw.

Background details:

`makeClouds`:
```js
g.clouds = [];
const n = Math.max(4, Math.round(view.w/210));
for(...){
 const scale = rand(0.5,1.25);
 g.clouds.push({x:rand(-100,view.w+100), y:rand(view.h*0.05, view.groundY*0.72), s:scale, speed:rand(5,16), lobes: Array.from({length: 4+...})})
}
```
lobes with dx,dy,r relative.

Draw clouds:
```js
ctx.save(); ctx.translate(c.x,c.y); ctx.scale(c.s,c.s);
ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,255,255,.85)';
for lobes: circle
base flat ellipse
ctx.restore();
```
Add subtle shadow underside with rgba(160,205,235,.35).

`makeDecor`:
grass tufts: 60 items across width with y below ground; trees: count; rocks; flowers.

Decor also includes distant field patches? Keep.

Draw:
```js
for trees: draw trunk and canopy (two circles) with color variation.
for rocks: ellipse gray.
for grass: 3 lines.
```
Draw after ground but before craters? Craters should be on ground; trees above craters fine. Draw craters before decor? Craters on top of ground; trees may stand in crater but okay. Order: ground, craters, decor, targets.

Targets drawing coordinate scale. Define `t.s = clamp(view.w/1000, .72, 1.08)`. Actually target sizes: bunker 70px wide at scale 1; mobile 0.75 => 52 px, good.

Target base y = groundY + 3; drawing translate(x, baseY); scale(s,s); all shapes relative to y=0 being ground.

Bunker:
```js
const w=70,h=46;
// shadow
// concrete body trapezoid
ctx.fillStyle='#6f7268'; path (-w/2,0) (-w/2+4,-h) (w/2-4,-h) (w/2,0)
// roof slab
ctx.fillStyle='#4b4e46'; fillRect(-w/2-4,-h-5,w+8,7)
// dark slit
// door
// sandbags bottom
// antenna + flag red
```
Flag: pole at x=18 from -h-5 up to -h-30; red triangle to right. Add waving via sin animate (small). Draw in canvas coordinates after scale; use time.

Tank:
```js
w=62,h=30
tracks: roundRect(-31,-12,62,14,7) dark
wheels circles
hull: roundRect(-28,-24,56,14,5) olive
turret: roundRect(-12,-34,30,12,5) olive
barrel: rect from (18,-32) to (40,-28)
antenna
red flag small
```
Radar:
- base trapezoid, mast line, dish: rotated ellipse arc, red blinking dot.
Fuel:
- two cylinders vertical: roundRect(-18,-40,16,40), roundRect(2,-30,14,30); caps; hazard stripes; skull? use warning triangle.
Rubble:
- mound with dark brown path, concrete chunks, smoke wisps? Add few static bits.
Also draw a red target marker "!"? Not needed.

Health bar: draw at y=-h-16 if hp<max.

Draw hit flash: radial white glow via globalCompositeOperation lighter, alpha t.flash.

Target hitbox w/h must match visuals + margin.

`drawTargets`: also draw a tiny "hedef" pointer? Not needed.

Shadows for targets.

Particles: need rings and puffs.

Particle creation explosion:
